This product is a Flutter (Dart) port of MPAndroidChart v4.0.1, ported from
the Kotlin sources at https://github.com/PhilJay/MPAndroidChart (commit
fae4ad798564ea9ad494eaf037dca0e745400723). The source code was translated
from Kotlin to Dart, and Android platform APIs were replaced by Flutter and
dart:ui equivalents; the differences from the original are listed in
MIGRATION.md.

The glyph extents in lib/src/graphics/roboto_glyph_extents.dart are derived
from the Roboto font (Apache License 2.0, Google).

The example app (example/assets/fonts) includes the Open Sans fonts
(Copyright 2010-2011 Google Corporation, Apache License 2.0), as
MPChartExample does.

The original NOTICE of MPAndroidChart follows.

